%% Closed-loop powder + water dispense sequence (Phase 1)
%% Render with Mermaid

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as UI / CLI
  participant Orch as Orchestrator
  participant Scale as HX711 Scale
  participant Auger as Auger + Stepper
  participant Vibe as Vibration
  participant Pump as Water Pump
  participant Mix as Mixer

  User->>UI: Select recipe / target grams + ml
  UI->>Orch: start_dispense(recipe)

  Note over Orch,Scale: Preflight
  Orch->>Scale: read_weight()
  Scale-->>Orch: raw / filtered
  Orch->>Orch: cup_present? / zero check
  alt No cup or scale fault
    Orch-->>UI: ABORT (NO_CUP / SCALE_FAULT)
  end
  Orch->>Scale: tare() / record zero baseline
  Scale-->>Orch: zero_ok

  Note over Orch,Vibe: Powder closed loop
  loop Until powder_mass >= target - overshoot_margin
    Orch->>Auger: short burst (N steps or t_ms)
    Orch->>Vibe: pulse (optional concurrent)
    Auger-->>Orch: done
    Orch->>Scale: settle_read(window_ms)
    Scale-->>Orch: current_mass
    Orch->>Orch: compute remaining; adapt burst size
    alt No progress after K bursts
      Orch->>Vibe: longer anti-jam vibrate
      Orch->>Orch: if still no progress → EMPTY/JAM fault
    end
  end

  Orch->>Vibe: settle vibration (short)
  Orch->>Scale: final_verify after settle
  Scale-->>Orch: powder_final
  alt |powder_final - target| > tolerance
    Orch-->>UI: WARN / ABORT (ACCURACY)
  end

  Note over Orch,Pump: Water dosing
  Orch->>Scale: optional re-baseline for water-on-scale strategy
  Orch->>Pump: run (timed | flow_pulses | until Δweight)
  Pump-->>Orch: complete
  Orch->>Scale: water_verify (if weight strategy)
  alt Low water / pump dry-run
    Orch-->>UI: ABORT (LOW_WATER)
  end

  Note over Orch,Mix: Mix
  Orch->>Mix: stir(duration)
  Mix-->>Orch: done

  Orch-->>UI: COMPLETE + log (powder_g, water_ml, errors)
  UI-->>User: Drink ready / status
